  "title": "Namaz for fulfillment of needs (2)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "ANOTHER NAMAZ FOR FULFILLMENT OF NEEDS (2)\n\nIn the fourth chapter of this book, I will mention a number of supplicatory prayers for settling the worldly and religious needs.\n\nIn al-Balad al-Amin, al-Kaf’ami states: For urgent needs, the following words may be written on a sheet of paper and then thrown in (current) water:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ مِنَ الْعَبْدِ الذَّلِيْلِ اِلَى الْمَوْلٰى الْجَلِيْلِ رَبِّ اِنِّىْ مَسَّنِىَ الضُّرُّ وَ اَنْتَ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِهٖ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِهٖ وَاكْشِفْ هَمِّىْ وَ فَرِّجْ عَنِّىْ غَمِّىْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEMI MINAL 'ABDIZ ZALEELI ILAL MAWLAL JALEELI RABBI INNEE MASSANIYAZ ZURRU WA ANTA ARHAMUR RAAHIMEENA BIHAQQI MUHAMMADIN WA AALIHEE SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIHEE WAKSHIF HAMMEE WA FARRIJ A'NNEE GHAMMEE BIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN.\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. From the lowly servant to the Majestic Master: My Lord, harm has afflicted me, and You are the most Merciful of the merciful. In the name of Muhammad and his Household, send blessings to Muhammad and his Household, remove my anxiety, and relieve me of my grief, by Your mercy, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy."
}
